-*   `o_min`: Minimum opacity threshold for pruning. Default: 0.005 [S8].
-*   `P_dense`: Percent dense hyperparameter. Default: 0.01 [S8].
-*   `e_scene`: Precomputed scene extent.
-*   `N_children`: Number of children in split. Default: 2 [S8].
